sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller
    participant Page as Browser page
    participant Agent
    participant Tool as Deterministic dispatcher
    participant API as Clinic backend
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Note over Page,API: Conversation already created, secrets stay outside model context
    Agent->>Tool: request_verification_code(customer_number)
    Tool->>API: POST verification/challenges with service and conversation tokens
    API-->>Page: Pending state, email code via Mailpit
    Caller->>Page: Type email code
    Page->>API: POST verification/verify directly
    API->>DB: Bind verified patient session
    API-->>Tool: Sanitized verified state (polled)
    Agent->>Tool: propose_booking(doctor_id=12, date=2026-10-15, start_time=14:00)
    Tool-->>Agent: Stored proposal id and summary
    Agent->>Page: Deliver immutable action summary
    Page-->>Tool: Delivery acknowledgement
    Caller->>Agent: New affirmative caller turn
    Agent->>Tool: confirm_pending_action(proposal_id)
    Tool->>API: POST /patients/me/appointments with stable idempotency key
    API->>DB: Identity revalidation, ownership, locks, business rules
    DB-->>API: 201 scheduled
    API-->>Tool: Sanitized result
    Tool-->>Agent: Tool result
    Agent-->>Caller: Explain actual outcome
    Note over Tool,API: Timeout means unknown outcome, reconcile using same key
